WEBVTT

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:37.470
It's the fairyland at the bottom of the universe.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:39.610
Dreams in a wasteland.

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:41.610
A town overrun with violence.

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:43.580
The idiot's utopia.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:48.040
The planet people call "Endless Illusion."

00:01:49.960 --> 00:01:52.090
A man named Van...

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.990
who operates the strongest Armor.

00:01:54.830 --> 00:01:56.730
A girl named Wendy...

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.720
who's searching for her abducted brother.

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:03.240
There is trouble and danger along the way...

00:02:03.240 --> 00:02:04.760
but never a dull moment.

00:02:05.570 --> 00:02:06.610
However this time...

00:02:06.610 --> 00:02:09.310
in the paradise port town of "Harbor Parade"...

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:12.280
a giant wave, the likes of which have never been seen before...

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:13.940
will come crashing down on them.

00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.850
Light My Fire

00:02:28.630 --> 00:02:31.530
I love you, my Muscat.

00:02:32.760 --> 00:02:34.820
I love you too, Honey Cherry.

00:02:36.030 --> 00:02:39.040
I've caused you trouble up 'til now, but I promise, starting tomorrow...

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.940
we're going to be waking up in paradise.

00:02:42.470 --> 00:02:44.010
We'll shower in champagne...

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:46.010
and make mad, passionate love...

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:48.280
to each other while wrapped in silk sheets.

00:02:48.980 --> 00:02:52.310
I'll never make you feel miserable because I don't have money.

00:02:53.050 --> 00:02:56.180
For me, any place is paradise as long as you're there.

00:02:56.990 --> 00:02:57.920
Honey Cherry!

00:02:58.360 --> 00:02:59.320
Muscat!

00:03:04.860 --> 00:03:06.090
You taste like cherry.

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:08.460
We're gonna be so happy, Muscat!

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:09.900
That's right. So...

00:03:11.300 --> 00:03:12.290
Put your hands up!

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.240
What the?

00:03:14.240 --> 00:03:14.970
Sir?!

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.680
You all have bad manners.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:20.340
Be quiet and keep eating!

00:03:20.710 --> 00:03:21.700
You too, little baby.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:24.810
Aren't you mistaking me with someone else?

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:26.070
No mistake.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:29.150
You're Van, the Pretty Man in the Garbage Heap.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:30.320
Nope.

00:03:30.320 --> 00:03:32.850
I'm Van, the unsung hero who gives everything he has.

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.920
You liked that name?

00:03:35.160 --> 00:03:37.420
Be quiet, little baby.

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:39.960
Do you have some business with Van?

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.570
I want you to hand over your Armor.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:45.930
My Armor? You mean Dann?

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:49.570
I'm gonna sell it off to Tony's gang and make tons of money.

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:53.640
They say your Armor is a little different from the other guys'.

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:56.340
Tony's the biggest Armor buff in town.

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:59.110
He'll pay anything for Pretty Garbage Van's Armor.

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:01.790
And we're going to use the money...

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:03.950
for our wedding in the town church!

00:04:04.520 --> 00:04:05.460
Now if you catch my drift...

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:06.650
hand over the Armor!

00:04:07.760 --> 00:04:10.320
I can't do that. Dann is my Armor.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:12.160
And mine alone.

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.600
You know they say a man's life is the only thing he's got.

00:04:15.600 --> 00:04:18.130
Nope. Dann is my life.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:20.400
The two of us are inseparable.

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.740
Do you wanna die? You wanna die?

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.540
We're serious. Aren't we, Muscat?

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:29.910
Right. Very well then.

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:33.990
Muscat!

00:04:33.990 --> 00:04:34.780
Excuse me!

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.130
Honey Cherry!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.230
Ouch!

00:04:44.230 --> 00:04:45.630
Hey! Catch!

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:50.200
Muscat, I'm sorry.

00:04:50.200 --> 00:04:51.930
You can't even catch your girlfriend.

00:04:52.540 --> 00:04:53.440
Get lost.

00:04:54.510 --> 00:04:55.770
We'll leave for now.

00:04:56.010 --> 00:04:58.740
But we'll meet again, "Pretty Garbage Van"!

00:04:58.740 --> 00:04:59.770
You stupid dumb!

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:01.310
What the hell was that?

00:05:04.120 --> 00:05:06.910
Sir, I'm truly sorry, but please...

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:08.880
get lost.

00:05:11.760 --> 00:05:13.350
I didn't realize the ocean was so big.

00:05:14.630 --> 00:05:16.180
And the weather's nice too.

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:20.490
I don't like this town.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:24.000
The people are idiots. And I can't get anything to eat.

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.230
It's not like that!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.360
It's cheerful. And it seems fun!

00:05:34.150 --> 00:05:35.840
Oh, it's adorable!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:39.050
Hey!

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.020
A man with an artificial right hand?

00:05:46.790 --> 00:05:49.420
Yeah. It's shaped like a claw.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:52.600
Beats me. I haven't heard anything either.

00:05:57.270 --> 00:05:58.040
Found 'em.

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.090
We found 'em!

00:05:59.940 --> 00:06:02.710
You again. What is that thing you're riding in?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.110
I can understand why you're blown away!

00:06:06.510 --> 00:06:09.050
That's right. I provided the body.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.640
And I remodeled it!

00:06:10.820 --> 00:06:11.650
It's truly.

00:06:11.650 --> 00:06:13.120
Our love child!

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.090
Love Deluxe!

00:06:15.090 --> 00:06:16.110
An amazing piece of Armor!

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:21.190
Sorry, but that thing isn't Armor.

00:06:21.530 --> 00:06:24.320
This gorgeous body! And lovely engine!

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.620
Quite frankly, no one has ever managed to escape!

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.690
From now on, you're Van, "Prisoner of Love."

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.460
So give it up and hand over the Armor!

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.940
You're not getting away!

00:06:37.740 --> 00:06:38.940
Love pinch!

00:06:41.010 --> 00:06:42.910
My store...

00:06:44.150 --> 00:06:46.240
Oops! Sorry! Pardon me! Brake shop!

00:06:46.550 --> 00:06:47.750
There, I've apologized!

00:06:47.950 --> 00:06:50.150
Muscat, I'll get him!

00:06:50.620 --> 00:06:52.750
All right then. Bye-bye, my love!

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.950
Love Machine! Go!

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.830
I'm counting on you, Honey Cherry!

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.570
What's that?

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.640
Oh no! Stand clear, little baby!

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:14.510
Wendy!

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:32.160
There's no need to thank me, baby.

00:07:32.530 --> 00:07:34.760
We'll never stop until we get his!

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.260
Muscat!

00:07:38.470 --> 00:07:40.230
How dare you! How dare you!

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:44.840
Oh, no!

00:07:44.840 --> 00:07:45.640
Muscat!

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:48.600
What have I done?

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:49.970
Honey Cherry!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.010
That face doesn't suit you.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:54.780
And Love Deluxe and I are indestructible.

00:07:55.420 --> 00:07:57.150
Don't you worry about me. Go get him!

00:07:59.360 --> 00:08:01.090
I love you, Muscat!

00:08:01.090 --> 00:08:01.850
I love you too!

00:08:09.200 --> 00:08:10.830
Van, over here! Over here!

00:08:11.270 --> 00:08:12.290
Hurry!

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.600
They'll find us again if we're outside.

00:08:17.440 --> 00:08:18.670
What is this place?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:31.260
Hallelujah!

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:33.550
And isn't this adorable!

00:08:34.130 --> 00:08:37.320
Don't worry about the age difference!

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:39.530
Fast...

00:08:39.730 --> 00:08:41.400
Marriage Service Church.

00:08:41.400 --> 00:08:45.600
Right! For 50,000 you can be married in 5 minutes!

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:46.600
It's great!

00:08:46.600 --> 00:08:48.770
I wonder if those two idiots were talking about this place.

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:50.640
What's that? Did someone tell you about us?

00:08:50.640 --> 00:08:53.080
That's right. In this town, it's OK.

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:56.510
It doesn't matter how old you are. We're all equal when it comes to love!

00:08:56.510 --> 00:08:58.610
Come on, get married now!

00:08:59.350 --> 00:09:00.220
Hey!

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:01.520
Don't blush, you idiot!

00:09:01.820 --> 00:09:02.650
But...

00:09:03.150 --> 00:09:04.050
Let's get out of here.

00:09:04.590 --> 00:09:06.390
I'd still rather be outside than in this place.

00:09:06.620 --> 00:09:07.250
Van!

00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:08.990
It's news from blue coast...

00:09:08.990 --> 00:09:10.590
They'll find us again!
It's news from blue coast...

00:09:10.930 --> 00:09:13.230
If it comes to it, I'll crush them with Dann!

00:09:13.770 --> 00:09:15.430
That's the same thing Ray would do.

00:09:19.570 --> 00:09:21.770
I really can't stand this town.

00:09:23.070 --> 00:09:24.170
I'm sorry.

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:27.230
I just thought that, since you seemed so down after meeting Ray.

00:09:27.880 --> 00:09:28.540
What?

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:30.880
Is that why we came to this town?

00:09:30.880 --> 00:09:32.150
This isn't a vacation.

00:09:32.150 --> 00:09:33.410
I'm after the Claw.

00:09:33.650 --> 00:09:35.390
And you're searching for your brother, aren't you?

00:09:35.390 --> 00:09:37.480
That's true, but...

00:09:38.260 --> 00:09:41.380
Although I don't know what's become of your brother.

00:09:41.760 --> 00:09:42.590
How can you say that!

00:09:42.890 --> 00:09:45.020
Do you have any guarantee he's all right?

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:50.260
My brother is...

00:09:54.440 --> 00:09:57.770
My brother, Michael, is alive.

00:09:58.610 --> 00:10:00.600
He's much smarter than I am and...

00:10:01.310 --> 00:10:02.340
he's got an iron will.

00:10:03.110 --> 00:10:03.910
He's very...

00:10:05.080 --> 00:10:09.110
For a long time he took care of me in place of my mom and dad.

00:10:10.520 --> 00:10:13.650
He was captured because he sacrificed himself...

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.250
so they couldn't find me.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:19.190
No one could kill someone as kind as that.

00:10:21.130 --> 00:10:24.500
I'm absolutely certain of that!

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:29.340
No, I...

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:31.810
Aloha!

00:10:33.410 --> 00:10:34.880
You don't know when to stop.

00:10:34.880 --> 00:10:37.040
Put us down now unless you want to be smashed to pieces!

00:10:37.250 --> 00:10:39.250
Then hand over the Armor first!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.580
Otherwise, I'll drop you from way up here.

00:10:41.890 --> 00:10:42.880
And if that happens...

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:44.550
it's gonna hurt!

00:10:49.360 --> 00:10:50.500
So what's it gonna be?

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:52.900
Are you gonna hand over the Armor or not?

00:10:52.900 --> 00:10:54.760
Make up your mind before I count down from ten.

00:10:55.170 --> 00:10:57.630
Ten... nine...

00:10:58.700 --> 00:10:59.770
- eight... seven...

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:00.370
- Van!
- Eight... seven...

00:11:00.370 --> 00:11:01.340
- eight... seven...

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:07.240
six... five... four...

00:11:07.910 --> 00:11:10.140
three... two...

00:11:17.290 --> 00:11:18.960
Honey Cherry!

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:19.820
Muscat!

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:30.640
Van!

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:32.600
I can't do anything with these guys around.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:33.430
But...

00:11:34.310 --> 00:11:36.070
you don't have to go that far.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:38.740
Hey!

00:11:39.180 --> 00:11:39.770
Yes!

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.480
Don't put your girl in harm's way!

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.410
Protect her!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.180
If you can't do that, then go home quietly.

00:11:47.790 --> 00:11:50.780
Next time you come after me, I'm not going to show you any mercy!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:12:00.730
Muscat, are you OK?

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:06.130
Bunny.

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.370
What is it, Klatt?

00:12:09.210 --> 00:12:11.040
You are my life.

00:12:11.310 --> 00:12:12.470
And you're mine.

00:12:13.240 --> 00:12:16.340
I could be happy even in hell, as long as you were there with me.

00:12:16.750 --> 00:12:17.680
Me too.

00:12:18.780 --> 00:12:21.050
Then there's no question about what to do.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:24.380
Even if that guy's for real.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.430
A guest whose hand is a claw?

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:32.060
I'm very sorry but...

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:33.330
I see.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:35.770
The thing is, there's something very important we need to give him.

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:39.330
In that case, perhaps I could check around at some other places.

00:12:39.770 --> 00:12:41.170
Thanks. That would be a big help.

00:12:53.150 --> 00:12:55.120
There's no helping you people.

00:12:57.860 --> 00:13:00.220
I thought I told you that next time you come after me...

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:02.720
I'm not going to show you any mercy!

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.660
Who's making all the racket in the lobby?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:10.530
I can't believe there are people with such bad manners in my town.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.870
What the?! Oh, no...

00:13:20.410 --> 00:13:21.170
Hey...

00:13:22.150 --> 00:13:24.010
You're Tony, aren't you?

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:27.290
The Armor... you did this?

00:13:27.290 --> 00:13:28.020
Yep.

00:13:28.020 --> 00:13:30.320
There's some damage, but it's amazing, isn't it?

00:13:30.320 --> 00:13:31.790
I remodeled it!

00:13:32.160 --> 00:13:33.260
Remodeled?

00:13:33.260 --> 00:13:33.850
That's right!

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:36.120
Now, I want to talk to you about something.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.000
I'm about to use the Love Deluxe...

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:39.860
to take Pretty Garbage Van's Armor away from him.

00:13:39.860 --> 00:13:41.470
I'd like for you to buy it.

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.260
I'll even remodel it for you, if you'd like me to.

00:13:43.470 --> 00:13:45.330
How dare you remodel my Armor!

00:13:46.140 --> 00:13:47.430
Daddy, stop it!

00:13:48.740 --> 00:13:49.710
Daddy?

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:54.140
I'm the one who took the Armor out.

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:56.780
I'm sorry I didn't tell you.

00:13:56.780 --> 00:13:59.680
I'm Tony's daughter, Bunny Montana.

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.380
Why did you wait until now?

00:14:03.190 --> 00:14:04.420
I thought you'd dump me...

00:14:04.420 --> 00:14:07.190
if you found out I was the daughter of a mafia boss.

00:14:07.190 --> 00:14:09.390
That's what all the others did up 'til now.

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:13.960
But Daddy, Klatt's not like the others!

00:14:14.270 --> 00:14:16.700
If you let him remodel the Armor, it'll be totally amazing!

00:14:25.480 --> 00:14:27.170
Bunny, why are you...

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:31.080
such a poor judge of Armor and men?

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:36.320
Always ending up with these crazy punks, and at your age.

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.290
Age?

00:14:46.600 --> 00:14:48.230
Take these two away.

00:14:48.230 --> 00:14:48.700
Yes sir!

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:52.090
Hey, what's my deal?

00:14:53.140 --> 00:14:55.240
Looks like you use Armor.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.330
But in my town, I am the law.

00:14:57.880 --> 00:14:58.860
Don't mess with me.

00:14:59.180 --> 00:15:01.340
Those guys chased me all over town.

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:02.750
Let me finish my business!

00:15:02.750 --> 00:15:04.340
It was good exercise, wasn't it?

00:15:04.780 --> 00:15:07.680
Now stop dressing like a clown and get a real job.

00:15:07.990 --> 00:15:08.880
What did you say?

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:15.830
Thatta boy.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:19.630
One night cruising in wonderful night.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:20.470
Parade for just two of you tonight. Hey.

00:15:20.470 --> 00:15:21.490
Parade for just two of you tonight.

00:15:21.830 --> 00:15:23.490
What's going to happen to them?

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:25.290
I don't know.

00:15:25.800 --> 00:15:28.030
Maybe they weren't all that bad people.

00:15:28.670 --> 00:15:30.300
But they weren't good either.

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:32.610
In other words, they were two ordinary people.

00:15:33.010 --> 00:15:35.480
And their deaths won't change anything.

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:38.310
Don't let it bother you.

00:15:39.280 --> 00:15:40.340
Their deaths?

00:15:41.290 --> 00:15:43.750
How could her own father do something like that?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.880
It's none of our business.

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:46.920
Let it be.

00:15:47.730 --> 00:15:48.750
I know.

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:57.670
Idiot.

00:16:03.210 --> 00:16:06.570
Defiling the family Armor is a serious crime.

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.850
There's only one way for you to make up for it.

00:16:15.650 --> 00:16:18.850
Tony, I tricked your daughter.

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.750
I was doing it for your Armor!

00:16:22.360 --> 00:16:25.300
It felt great riding in both of them.

00:16:26.430 --> 00:16:27.520
Muscat!

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:30.130
Don't call me that you stupid bitch!

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:33.470
Wake up already. It's time for you to go on home.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:39.380
Protecting the woman you love by taking all the blame yourself.

00:16:39.380 --> 00:16:41.640
A shallow ploy well suited for an idiot.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:43.050
But very well...

00:16:43.050 --> 00:16:46.020
on account of it, I'll spare Bunny.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:50.420
Bunny, kill him and...

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:53.120
I'll forget about this thing.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:55.960
How?

00:16:57.190 --> 00:16:59.490
How can you forget about this?

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:03.300
In the end, that's all you think of me!

00:17:03.870 --> 00:17:05.670
The only thing you care about is Armor!

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.170
Bunny...

00:17:08.570 --> 00:17:10.010
Open your eyes, Daddy.

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:11.770
Bunny is long since gone.

00:17:12.440 --> 00:17:14.600
The person standing here is Klatt's wife.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:19.510
It's Honey Cherry.

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:31.060
I love you, Muscat.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.260
I love you too, Honey Cherry.

00:17:33.630 --> 00:17:35.760
You fools are meant for each other.

00:17:35.930 --> 00:17:38.700
But on account of the family and the Armor...

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:40.670
fools cannot be forgiven.

00:17:41.840 --> 00:17:43.430
At least it'll be by my own hand.

00:17:46.040 --> 00:17:47.100
What's that?

00:18:00.730 --> 00:18:02.450
It's the guy from earlier today.

00:18:07.400 --> 00:18:08.590
The vast ocean.

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:10.660
The refreshing breeze.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:12.430
The cheerful people.

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.460
The bustling street corners.

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:16.900
I didn't think...

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.900
this place was for me from the start.

00:18:20.110 --> 00:18:21.510
And I was right.

00:18:21.710 --> 00:18:23.270
What are you doing here?

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:25.780
What am I doing here?

00:18:26.420 --> 00:18:28.020
No matter how you look at it...

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:30.350
there's no reason for me to help these two.

00:18:31.290 --> 00:18:33.980
That's obvious. They attacked you, didn't they?

00:18:34.430 --> 00:18:35.760
That's right.

00:18:35.760 --> 00:18:37.390
Today was the worst.

00:18:37.830 --> 00:18:40.500
That's why I've decided to use you to get my mind off of it.

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:41.590
Get your mind off of it?

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:43.860
Is it a goddamn idiot fest tonight?

00:18:45.600 --> 00:18:46.570
I'm an idiot!

00:18:46.570 --> 00:18:47.130
You!

00:18:49.840 --> 00:18:50.780
Yeah.

00:18:50.780 --> 00:18:52.370
We're at the beach. Hurry!

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:57.440
Pretty Garbage Van.

00:18:58.580 --> 00:18:59.410
Idiot!

00:19:03.490 --> 00:19:06.010
Thanks for getting so many of them to come!

00:19:06.190 --> 00:19:07.350
Muscat!

00:19:07.560 --> 00:19:08.620
Honey Cherry!

00:19:11.900 --> 00:19:13.060
This calls for...

00:19:20.200 --> 00:19:21.870
That's enough, punk.

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:25.100
I'm gonna use my Armor to put an end to this horseplay.

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:36.220
Take a look! This is my Armor.

00:19:36.420 --> 00:19:39.450
3000 horsepower with 3000 weapons on board.

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:42.060
The name is "Tony 3000"too.

00:19:42.730 --> 00:19:45.790
Like I said, that thing isn't Armor.

00:19:46.400 --> 00:19:48.830
You call your Armor too. We'll see who's is the best!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.730
I don't think that's necessary.

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:54.400
In that case, I'm going to give you something to regret!

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:02.770
You're not getting away!

00:20:04.350 --> 00:20:05.370
Coward!

00:20:11.960 --> 00:20:13.250
Oh, no!

00:20:20.000 --> 00:20:21.690
How dare you do that to my Armor!

00:20:22.930 --> 00:20:24.900
Thank you, Pretty Garbage Van.

00:20:25.400 --> 00:20:26.870
I owe my life to you.

00:20:27.340 --> 00:20:30.100
And so I'm through with trying to get your Armor.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:32.840
We'll thank you by giving you a new name!

00:20:33.340 --> 00:20:34.710
You're a good person so...

00:20:34.710 --> 00:20:35.580
Good Person, Van!

00:20:37.210 --> 00:20:38.110
Good person?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:44.050
I love you, Muscat.

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:46.510
I love you too, Honey Cherry.

00:20:47.290 --> 00:20:52.000
Well, it's a good car, but there's a glut in the used-car market...

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:53.460
and it needs maintenance.

00:20:53.900 --> 00:20:56.260
Also, what are your plans for fixing up that one?

00:20:56.530 --> 00:20:57.640
Don't worry about that one.

00:20:57.640 --> 00:20:58.620
I'm gonna do it.

00:20:59.370 --> 00:21:01.130
Then I guess 100,000 is all I can do.

00:21:02.310 --> 00:21:04.000
Thanks. That's plenty.

00:21:04.880 --> 00:21:06.400
Hallelujah!

00:21:07.480 --> 00:21:09.540
Our love story begins.

00:21:09.810 --> 00:21:13.750
After the ceremony, we'll head for paradise in Love Deluxe.

00:21:13.750 --> 00:21:15.950
You're awesome, Muscat!

00:21:16.290 --> 00:21:18.310
You two, follow me!

00:21:23.560 --> 00:21:25.150
I'm sorry, Van.

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:27.090
Why are you apologizing?

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:30.730
Well, I suppose I said some things I shouldn't have as well.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:32.960
Thanks for waiting.

00:21:33.870 --> 00:21:38.000
Say, you didn't happen to see a man with a claw, did you?

00:21:38.780 --> 00:21:40.980
He might have been here with a kid, a boy.

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:43.740
Oh sure, I know! He's right over there.

00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:45.150
He's here now?

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:46.310
He's sitting over there.

00:21:48.190 --> 00:21:50.310
He was there until just a minute ago.

00:21:50.920 --> 00:21:53.450
He was talking about what time he could catch a boat or something.

00:21:55.960 --> 00:21:56.650
My brother.

00:21:58.260 --> 00:21:59.090
I found him!

00:21:59.930 --> 00:22:00.950
I've cornered him!

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:02.430
Elena.

00:22:03.670 --> 00:22:05.100
At last, I've finally got him!

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:17.350
Which one?

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:18.980
Where is he?

00:23:53.240 --> 00:23:55.310
The Vengeance Within

00:23:55.310 --> 00:23:59.280
To tell you the truth, I can't really remember the place...
The Vengeance Within

00:23:59.280 --> 00:24:00.550
The Vengeance Within

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:04.420
where it was, or how long we were there.
The Vengeance Within

00:24:04.420 --> 00:24:05.990
The Vengeance Within

00:24:05.990 --> 00:24:07.990
I just remember that...
The Vengeance Within

00:24:07.990 --> 00:24:11.630
it was a very quiet and very pretty place.
The Vengeance Within

00:24:11.630 --> 00:24:12.600
The Vengeance Within

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:14.600
It was a place where time seemed to stand still...
The Vengeance Within

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:15.370
The Vengeance Within

00:24:15.370 --> 00:24:18.440
and it felt as if we had stepped into a picture.
The Vengeance Within

00:24:18.440 --> 00:24:19.340
The Vengeance Within
